      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file `upsert_document.py` that upserts a JSON document by its primary identifier using a concrete external provider, I need to choose a provider that offers a document database service. Amazon DynamoDB is a suitable choice as it is a managed NoSQL database service that provides fast and predictable performance with seamless scalability. I will use the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to interact with DynamoDB. </thinking>\n",
